nt issue.)","tree":{"sha":"ef8c55137ac688a73bb18ad98e74e87119b7f866","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/numpy/numpy/git/trees/ef8c55137ac688a73bb18ad98e74e87119b7f866"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/numpy/numpy/git/commits/8568549c93a404df415244053affda5df02eb8e1","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsBcBAABCAAQBQJlTyNRCRBK7hj4Ov3rIwAA5EQIAAZCe8GHPoE8k7Pmpa/FGRaj\nO99vUuZuooJWVNhuj2oxPoC8yPdS8sgI9izE8OGStukPtob9AUS5xn6PAdZAT2y4\n9gpfBnW1cH0fJ8jS/0uSIKOprNcTbMZgDoW+G1DXiuSfflTYumVgB4tEsEJIQlts\ngw9ctjalKSaBl0bqMFPjhLLGdCPUArtLlGdtdIhw2A5KXlI375/B1qYNs0HZEYOS\nxXEGm7SHue8hqRfbbbHB2G8ALSpnmHT7yADEwVA8vpuwrmWxOrEHJ9uJPkYHknaK\nn4Prq5OEidOxawYEPdTnJeDWSj6Oy/jmRacvcG/qsHfFEdzBoWy3UGPwCn64TaI=\n=NcRK\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree ef8c55137ac688a73bb18ad98e74e87119b7f866\nparent 893db31bdaf69f539e90be9b86cab83b86d98c3b\nauthor Matt Haberland <mhaberla@calpoly.edu> 1699685201 -0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1699685201 +0100\n\nDOC: standardize capitalization of NEP headings (#25060)\n\nMore toward gh-16261.\r\n\r\ngh-16261 reported that documentation headings currently have inconsistent capitalization schemes and should be standardized. gh-25016 fixed this for rst files except release notes and NEPS. This PR adjusts the NEPs.\r\n\r\nThe case of 'numpy', 'blas', 'scipy', 'python', 'lapack', 'fortran', 'api', 'pypi', 'cpu', 'abi', 'pr', 'github', 'ssh', 'git', 'f77', 'numba', 'f2py', 'cffi', 'bitgenerator', 'simd', 'swig', 'csv', 'ascii', 'json', 'dataframe', 'ieee', 'matlab', 'pyfort', ' c ', and 'nep' are unchanged. (Perhaps it would be a good idea to check the capitalization of some of these words throughout the documentation, but that is a different issue.)","verified_at":"2024-01-16T19:59:59Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/numpy/numpy/commits/8568549c93a404df415244053affda5df02eb8e1","html_url":"https://github.com/numpy/numpy/commit/8568549c93a404df41